{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you awoke in a dark, sealed room, you were the last surviving fairy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon, you meet the little fairy, Sir Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, an adventure to uncover the world's secrets begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=172 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet humans showing hostility, giant robots, and others living through the apocalypse, each with their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will decide their fate and the direction of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Sorry, we haven't localized this gif yet! We'll try to update it when we have time!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through barren wastelands and human caves, towards the truth hidden in the old kingdom at the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet companions and helpers, collect various weapons, and fight against the enemies who stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=219 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 A Dark Fairytale, Drawn in Pixel Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a top-down world rendered in pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep narrative that uncovers the secrets of a fallen race and a collapsing world, hidden behind a seemingly cheerful atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 The Enigmatic Companion, 'Sir Leonardo'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only friend who helps you is the little fairy, Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a legend of another, greater 'Sir Leonardo' exists in this world\u2014one you do not know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Diverse Combat Styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any weapon you've touched can be summoned at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon swords, bows, and various other weapons to suit the situation, cast spells, and activate runes to create your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 A Fate Forged by Your Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fates of characters, the future of the world, and the story's ending will change based on your choices and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of ending will you face?<strong>     </strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1737520?t=1751537301","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1737520?t=1751537301","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751537301","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751537301","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you awoke in a dark, sealed room, you were the last surviving fairy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But soon, you meet the little fairy, Sir Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, an adventure to uncover the world's secrets begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/a87fc4581c7771c5af4853a42700711e.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=172 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet humans showing hostility, giant robots, and others living through the apocalypse, each with their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will decide their fate and the direction of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Sorry, we haven't localized this gif yet! We'll try to update it when we have time!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/9c92803c68045542d7346a1f074fc428.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through barren wastelands and human caves, towards the truth hidden in the old kingdom at the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/85d0cea9c8794766302df58041df9257.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet companions and helpers, collect various weapons, and fight against the enemies who stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.webp?t=1751537301\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/extras/58239789649bcd06c92ebe14d755b4f9.poster.webp?t=1751537301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=219 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 A Dark Fairytale, Drawn in Pixel Art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a top-down world rendered in pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep narrative that uncovers the secrets of a fallen race and a collapsing world, hidden behind a seemingly cheerful atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 The Enigmatic Companion, 'Sir Leonardo'</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only friend who helps you is the little fairy, Leonardo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a legend of another, greater 'Sir Leonardo' exists in this world\u2014one you do not know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Diverse Combat Styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any weapon you've touched can be summoned at will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon swords, bows, and various other weapons to suit the situation, cast spells, and activate runes to create your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 A Fate Forged by Your Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fates of characters, the future of the world, and the story's ending will change based on your choices and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of ending will you face?<strong>     </strong></p>","developers":["Team OOPArts"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1737520/header.jpg?t=1751537301","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Frostory","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hardware Accelerated Graphics with dedicated memory, 1GB memory recommended<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li>